{start_of_verse label="Verse 1"}
[G]Frère Jacques, frère Jacques,
[G]Dormez-vous? Dormez-vous?
[D]Sonnez les ma[G]tines,
[D]Sonnez les ma[G]tines,
[G]Ding, [D]dang, [G]dong. [G]Ding, [D]dang, [G]dong.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Verse 2"}
[G]Are you sleeping, are you sleeping,
[G]Brother John, Brother John?
[D]Morning bells are [G]ringing,
[D]Morning bells are [G]ringing,
[G]Ding, [D]dang, [G]dong. [G]Ding, [D]dang, [G]dong.
{end_of_verse}
